var e=[{id:`wa-direct-message-architecture`,title:`WA Direct Message: Privacy-First Utility Reaching 50,000+ Users`,client:`CypherEdge Products Division`,category:`Mobile Utility & Privacy`,image:`/assets/ic_directMessage.png`,color:`#1FB14A`,summary:`Engineered a privacy-first utility app enabling direct WhatsApp messaging without contact saving, reaching 50,000+ active users with 100% on-device execution.`,challenge:`Traditional messaging helper apps collect phone numbers and contact metadata on remote servers, creating privacy risks, backend hosting expenses, and user trust issues.`,solution:`Built a zero-backend, 100% local architecture utilizing iOS & Android native deep-link schemas, local template caching, and StoreKit subscription funnels — ensuring no user data ever leaves the device.`,architecture:[`Zero-Backend On-Device Deep-Link Engine`,`Local Encrypted Template & Phone Number History Storage`,`Native iOS (SwiftUI) & Android (Kotlin) Architecture`,`StoreKit 2 & Google Play Billing Subscription Integration`],measurableOutcome:`50,000+ active users with 4.8/5 App Store rating and zero data breach incidents since launch.`,results:[{metric:`50,000+`,label:`Active Users`},{metric:`100%`,label:`On-Device Privacy`},{metric:`4.8 / 5`,label:`App Store Rating`}],techStack:[`Swift`,`SwiftUI`,`Kotlin`,`StoreKit 2`,`WhatsApp DeepLink API`],ctaText:`Need a privacy-first mobile app?`},{id:`digital-dukaan-pos`,title:`Digital Dukaan: POS Platform Serving 30,000+ Merchants`,client:`CypherEdge Products Division`,category:`Business & Enterprise`,image:`/assets/ic_digitalDukaan.png`,color:`#3B82F6`,summary:`Built a comprehensive POS and business management platform enabling retailers and wholesalers to manage inventory, track sales, and process transactions at scale.`,challenge:`Small and medium businesses needed affordable, reliable digital tools to manage inventory and sales — but existing solutions were either too complex or required constant internet connectivity.`,solution:`Engineered an offline-first POS platform with cloud sync capabilities, supporting multi-device access, real-time inventory management, and digital invoice generation.`,architecture:[`Offline-First Architecture with Background Cloud Sync`,`Firebase Firestore Real-time Database Layer`,`React Native Cross-Platform Mobile Application`,`Node.js API with SQLite Local Caching`],measurableOutcome:`30,000+ active merchants processing $10M+ in transactions with 99.99% platform uptime.`,results:[{metric:`$10M+`,label:`Transactions Processed`},{metric:`30,000+`,label:`Active Merchants`},{metric:`99.99%`,label:`Platform Uptime`}],techStack:[`React Native`,`Firebase Firestore`,`Node.js`,`SQLite`],ctaText:`Building a business platform?`},{id:`truth-or-dare-game-engine`,title:`Truth or Dare: Viral Party Game Reaching 100,000+ Players`,client:`CypherEdge Gaming`,category:`Mobile Gaming & Haptics`,image:`/assets/media__1780778288892.png`,color:`#EF4444`,summary:`Created a viral multiplayer party game with CoreHaptics 3D wheel physics, custom deck creators, and multi-language localization scaling to 100,000+ players globally.`,challenge:`Party apps suffer low engagement if wheel spinning feels static or lacks real physical feedback, and question decks become repetitive without user-generated content.`,solution:`Designed a custom SwiftUI physics wheel with synchronized CoreHaptics force feedback, paired with user-generated deck creation and dynamic difficulty scaling across 10+ languages.`,architecture:[`CoreHaptics Physics-Synchronized Spin Wheel Engine`,`User-Generated Card Deck Serialization & Local Caching`,`Multi-language Localization Matrix (10+ Languages)`,`High-Conversion In-App Subscription Paywall Engine`],measurableOutcome:`100,000+ global players with 2M+ game sessions and 4.8/5 App Store rating.`,results:[{metric:`100,000+`,label:`Global Players`},{metric:`2M+`,label:`Game Sessions`},{metric:`4.8 / 5`,label:`App Store Rating`}],techStack:[`SwiftUI`,`CoreHaptics`,`Combine`,`StoreKit 2`,`CoreData`],ctaText:`Have a consumer app idea?`}];export{e as t};